{"id":"0407a62a7ce39e04","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-cat-monad.md","title":"ZFC Cat Monad","display":"df-zfc-cat-monad — ZFC Cat Monad","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-monad","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-monad"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-monad — ZFC Cat Monad","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-monad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-monad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-monad — ZFC Cat Monad"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\eta,\\mu,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(T,\\eta,\\mu,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded category data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonad}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonad}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (natural-transformation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}monad}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonad}_S(T,\\eta,\\mu,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C},T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\mu,T\\circ T,T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu_X\\circ T(\\mu_X)=\\mu_X\\circ\\mu_{T(X)}\n\\land\\mu_X\\circ T(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\n\\land\\mu_X\\circ\\eta_{T(X)}=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}monad}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonad}_S(T,\\eta,\\mu,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C},T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\mu,T\\circ T,T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu_X\\circ T(\\mu_X)=\\mu_X\\circ\\mu_{T(X)}\n\\land\\mu_X\\circ T(\\eta_X)=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\n\\land\\mu_X\\circ\\eta_{T(X)}=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three final equalities are the associativity and two unit laws written componentwise, so whiskering is no longer hidden in ambiguous expressions such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\mu\">\\(T\\mu\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu T\">\\(\\mu T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-fu